BT /F2 9 Tf 1 0.6 0 rg 60 785.0 Td (T LEVEL GUIDE) Tj ET
BT /F2 26 Tf 1 1 1 rg 60 749.0 Td (Parent and carer guide) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.85 0.88 0.92 rg 60 727.0 Td (If your child is thinking about a T Level, here's what you need to know,) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0.85 0.88 0.92 rg 60 709.0 Td (and a few questions that are worth asking.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 0.14 0.18 0.24 rg 60 631.0 Td (What is a T Level?) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.14 0.18 0.24 rg 60 614.0 Td (A T Level is a 2-year course for 16 to 19 year olds, taken after GCSEs. It's a Level 3) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.14 0.18 0.24 rg 60 599.0 Td (qualification, the same size as 3 A levels. Each one focuses on a single area of work, such as) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.14 0.18 0.24 rg 60 584.0 Td (Digital, Business, Finance or Engineering, so your child learns skills that employers actually) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.14 0.18 0.24 rg 60 569.0 Td (use.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 0.14 0.18 0.24 rg 60 533.0 Td (How their time is spent) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.14 0.18 0.24 rg 60 516.0 Td (Most of the course, about 80%, is in the classroom. The other 20% is an industry placement) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.14 0.18 0.24 rg 60 501.0 Td (with a real employer. The placement lasts at least 315 hours, which is about 45 days. Some) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.14 0.18 0.24 rg 60 486.0 Td (colleges run it as one block, others as a day a week, and some mix the two.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 0.14 0.18 0.24 rg 60 450.0 Td (Will they be paid on placement?) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.14 0.18 0.24 rg 60 433.0 Td (Not necessarily. There's no legal requirement for employers to pay T Level students,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.14 0.18 0.24 rg 60 418.0 Td (although some choose to. It's worth asking the college what's usual for the placements) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.14 0.18 0.24 rg 60 403.0 Td (they arrange.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 0.14 0.18 0.24 rg 60 367.0 Td (What about English and maths?) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.14 0.18 0.24 rg 60 350.0 Td (If your child hasn't got grade 4 in English and maths yet, they'll keep working towards it) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.14 0.18 0.24 rg 60 335.0 Td (during the course. They don't need it to pass their T Level.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 0.14 0.18 0.24 rg 60 299.0 Td (What can it lead to?) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.14 0.18 0.24 rg 78 282.0 Td (A skilled job) Tj ET
